  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/10/IMG_3166.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>El Club Pilotari d&#39;Onda ha dedicado todo este lunes a practicar este deporte en el trinquete municipal. La jornada ha concluido con la partida en la que Pablo de Borriol y Josep de Vila-real han ganado por un ajustado 60-55 a Kevin de Onda y &nbsp;V&iacute;ctor de Meliana. Todo en 22 fotos.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/partidapilotafira14/img_3139.jpg\" alt=\"img_3139\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/partidapilotafira14/img_3140.jpg\" alt=\"img_3140\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/partidapilotafira14/img_3143.jpg\" alt=\"img_3143\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/partidapilotafira14/img_3145.jpg\" alt=\"img_3145\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/partidapilotafira14/img_3149.jpg\" alt=\"img_3149\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/partidapilotafira14/img_3153.jpg\" alt=\"img_3153\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/partidapilotafira14/img_3154.jpg\" alt=\"img_3154\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/partidapilotafira14/img_3155.jpg\" alt=\"img_3155\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/partidapilotafira14/img_3157.jpg\" alt=\"img_3157\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439ef